  "138": {
    "inputs": {
      "value": "**subject_definitions**\n<Subject 1> is the warrior from the first reference image (Mahabali), featuring dark shoulder-length wavy hair, a thick prominent mustache, muscular bare golden-bronze chest, gold collar necklace with red gem, gold armlets, and a red-and-gold dhoti.\n<Subject 2> is the warrior from the second reference image (Indra), featuring clean-shaven sharp facial features, polished gold cuirass armor with blue gemstone embellishments, gold armlets, and a royal blue-and-gold dhoti.\n<Subject 3> is the ascetic warrior from the third reference image (Parasurama), featuring long dark greenish-black hair tied in a high ascetic bun, full dark beard, blue-toned temple paint, bare muscular chest with a long brown prayer bead mala and sacred cord, and an off-white cotton dhoti cinched with a brown sash.\n\n**summary**\n[reference generation] In a sun-drenched, dust-swept ancient arena, <Subject 1> commands the center foreground delivering his fierce challenge, flanked on his right by the smug armored <Subject 2> and on his left by the grim, stoic warrior-sage <Subject 3>.\n\n**retention_analysis**\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - Facial features, mustache, long hair, bare muscular build, gold ornaments, and red-and-gold dhoti are fully preserved.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - Clean-shaven face, gold cuirass with blue gems, and royal blue-and-gold dhoti are fully preserved.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - Hair bun, full beard, facial markings, bead necklace, bare torso, and off-white dhoti with brown sash are fully preserved.\n\n**detailed_description**\n[Shot 1]\nMedium-full shot, low-angle dynamic slow push-in. In the center foreground of the sunlit, dusty stone arena, <Subject 1> stands grounded and chest out, thrusting an open arm toward the cheering crowd stands. To his right, <Subject 2> crosses his armored arms with a sharp smirk (sound of metal armor shifting and gold jewelry jingling). To his left, <Subject 3> stands tall and rigid, his intense dark eyes scanning the arena in grim silence with hands resting naturally at his sides (sound of coarse linen fluttering in the breeze).\n<Subject 1> (S1): \"Is there no one else?!\"\n(sound of deep, booming baritone challenge echoing off high stone walls). <Subject 2> gives an amused chuckle, while <Subject 3> remains stoic and watchful as desert dust swirls around their feet.\n\n**overall_soundscape**\nRoaring colosseum crowd echoes, whistling arid wind, swirling sand on stone, metal armor shifting, rhythmic clinking of heavy beads and gold ornaments.\n\n**non_diegetic_music**\nMassive, heroic war orchestration featuring driving timpani drums, low brass horn blasts, and intense rising string textures."
    },
